i-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"494fa4cd0ce92258\" href=\"?note=494fa4cd0ce92258\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §7.4 print376/PDF388 (Harrington); §3.2.5 print354/PDF366 (PA/HA); Simpson SOSOA 2nd ed. §I.3 (ACA0/PA), <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statements-checked; explicit syntax translation; complete conservation proofs not independently reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-conservation-results-—-Conservation-results\">thm-conservation-results — Conservation-results</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\mathsf{PA}\">\\(\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\mathsf{PA}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"109b0b8d7ee4cec9\" href=\"?note=109b0b8d7ee4cec9\" title=\"72-df-wkl0\">72-df-wkl0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"89c91257b92fc1e7\" href=\"?note=89c91257b92fc1e7\" title=\"72-df-aca0\">72-df-aca0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a> 的公理句集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2\">\\(\\vdash_2\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a> 的实际有限两类变量Hilbert推导。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1,\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing),\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\Pi^1_1,\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing),\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a> 的实际句法类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HA}_{72},\\vdash_N,E_f,\\Pi^{0,72}_2\">\\(\\mathsf{HA}_{72},\\vdash_N,E_f,\\Pi^{0,72}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"494fa4cd0ce92258\" href=\"?note=494fa4cd0ce92258\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</a> 的独立直觉主义语法及经典翻译。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\Pi^1_1\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)\\ (\\mathsf{WKL}_0\\vdash_2 A\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf{RCA}_0\\vdash_2 A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\Pi^1_1\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)\\ (\\mathsf{WKL}_0\\vdash_2 A\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf{RCA}_0\\vdash_2 A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)\\ (\\mathsf{ACA}_0\\vdash_2 A\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf{PA}\\vdash_2 A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)\\ (\\mathsf{ACA}_0\\vdash_2 A\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf{PA}\\vdash_2 A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\Pi^{0,72}_2\\ (\\mathsf{PA}\\vdash_2 E_f(A)\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\Pi^{0,72}_2\\ (\\mathsf{PA}\\vdash_2 E_f(A)\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分别为Harrington的Π¹₁保守性、ACA₀对PA的一阶保守性、PA对HA的Π⁰₂保守性在基本无量词矩阵句类中的实例。第三式显式翻译两套语法；不会将root Fml2的¬∀¬式存在宏当作直觉主义存在节点。原任意共同语言T1⊆T2声明与这里PA/HA不同逻辑推导并不匹配，已删除。来源陈述已核对，三个深层保守性证明没有在本条重建；资格保持false。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-conservation-results-—-Conservation-results","text":"thm-conservation-results — Conservation-results","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-base-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-wkl0","status":"resolved","id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-wkl0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-aca0","status":"resolved","id":"89c91257b92fc1e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-aca0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":